                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Rather than stating this, can you just quote the spec?  I see you have the sections listed, which is a start, but lets just quote EXACTLY what the spec says about this so it's obvious why we made the change.\n\nI also don't see where section 6.7 states what the format you claimed it did.  Section 10.1 talks about a file name, but it isn't clear to me that applies to the URI/ID in use.  I'm not against this change by any means, but lets make sure we're calling out where we're improving for the sake of improving, versus where we're improving because the spec says so."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/message_registries.hpp",
                    "line": 201,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "This is a good section to break out into a helper method, but can you please do it separate from the functional change?  I'm having a little trouble separating the functional changes from just breaking this helper method out.\n\nAlso, if you're able to write unit tests for the new function, they'd be appreciated."
                },
                {
